---
---

<section id="about" class="relative z-20 py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-white/8 bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#0B1120] rounded-t-3xl shadow-[0_-16px_40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)] dark:shadow-[0_-16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 w-full">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Profile Photo Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative max-w-sm mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 shadow-sm relative group">
            <img 
              src="/profile.webp" 
              alt="Mohamad Arifin Hasbi — Full Stack Developer, AI Engineer, dan Cloud Computing Enthusiast"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
              width="400"
              height="400"
              draggable="false"
              data-watermark
            />
          </div>
          <!-- Decorative accent box -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-50/80 dark:bg-blue-950/20 rounded-2xl -z-10 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/30 hidden sm:block"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div 
          data-i18n="aboutEyebrow"
          class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0047FF] dark:text-[#60A5FA] mb-2"
        >
          Tentang Saya
        </div>
        
        <h2 
          data-i18n="aboutTitle"
          class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6"
        >
          Portfolio Mohamad Arifin Hasbi — AI Engineer &amp; Full Stack Developer
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8">
          <p data-i18n="aboutParagraph1">
            Saya, Mohamad Arifin Hasbi, adalah mahasiswa aktif Semester 6 program studi Teknik Informatika di STMIK Mardira Indonesia dengan IPK 3.64/4.00. Saya memiliki ketertarikan mendalam pada pengembangan perangkat lunak modern, Artificial Intelligence, Cloud Computing, dan Machine Learning.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="aboutParagraph2">
            Selama studi, saya telah membangun sistem web menggunakan Java (Spring Boot), PHP (Laravel, CodeIgniter), dan JavaScript/TypeScript (React). Saya juga aktif mengeksplorasi Google Cloud Platform untuk deployment dan analisis data, serta menerapkan teknik Machine Learning dalam proyek sistem pakar.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sertifikasi & Mata Kuliah Highlight -->
        <div class="mb-8 p-4 rounded-xl glass-card">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0047FF] dark:text-[#60A5FA]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20"/></svg>
            <span data-i18n="aboutCoursesTitle">Sertifikasi &amp; Mata Kuliah Relevan</span>
          </div>
          <p data-i18n="aboutCoursesList" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-secondary">
            Google Cloud Skill Badge (Natural Language API), Pemrograman Berbasis Objek (PBO), Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak, Basis Data, Pemrograman Web, Sistem Pakar, Struktur Data &amp; Algoritma.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Stats Bento-style -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl glass-card text-center sm:text-left">
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat1Value" class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary">3+</div>
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat1Label" class="text-xs text-text-muted font-medium mt-0.5">Proyek Utama</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl glass-card text-center sm:text-left">
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat2Value" class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0047FF] dark:text-[#60A5FA]">3.64</div>
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat2Label" class="text-xs text-text-muted font-medium mt-0.5">IPK / 4.00</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl glass-card text-center sm:text-left">
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat3Value" class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary">Sem 6</div>
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat3Label" class="text-xs text-text-muted font-medium mt-0.5">STMIK Mardira</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
